# Fault gap_register (writer 6): gap(wallet, d) printed no register, and flows of the pad's other end didn't list the
# plan its size rests on. L §8.2: "The list is transitive: whatever its evaluation read, through any chain (N-713)";
# L §5.19: "The gap at a stated reading is the reading less the booked balance at its instant"; "pad x from y: each gap
# is taken up by a movement of the prelude kind pads ... of the gap's size". The booked balance at 2025-01-31 end is
# 400.00 + 300.00 (atm, a plan before the cut that nothing fulfils: unfulfilled: atm) = 700.00; stated 250.00: the gap
# is -450.00 DUK and lists `unfulfilled: atm`; the pad of 450.00 runs from wallet to spent, so flows(spent, 2025-01) =
# 450.00 DUK, listing the pad and `unfulfilled: atm`. q_mid: 700.00 DUK.
# Writer 7: spent is now `outside DUK`: L §5.14.3 (round 12) refuses flows of a place of unit any (LOAD-UNIT) unless the
# flows converts, and the fault's text had spent of unit any.
# (Writer 8: L §5.10 refuses a unit stated on a place whose kind isn't of unit one, so `outside PLN` is gone; the place
# read by flows is now a thing of its own outside kind of one unit, `kind payees: place DUK signed outside`, since
# flows of a place of unit any is refused, L §5.14.3.)
=== flow01.tally
model flow01
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-25
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-01-31
  note "FLOW-01: a wallet counted twice; the balancing flow between the counts."
  note "The first count opens the wallet (opening, LANGUAGE 4.6, 5.19). The second is a stated balance whose gap is padded from an outside place: the pad is the one balancing flow, booked at the reading (5.19), and gap(wallet, d) is its signed size."

source card "Probe card FLOW-01 (made up): story and rules"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place bank: outside lives 2025-01-01..

kind payees: place DUK signed outside
place spent: payees lives 2025-01-01..

place wallet: cash DUK lives 2025-01-01..

input atm_amount: money DUK

input atm_day: date

move atm: transfers
  on atm_day
  leg cash from bank to wallet amount atm_amount
  note "the cash machine draws on Halina's bank account, which the card doesn't record: an outside place"

ask q_gap: gap(wallet, 2025-01-31)

ask q_spent: flows(spent, 2025-01)

ask q_mid: bal(wallet, 2025-01-20)

ask q_holds: check bal(wallet, 2025-01-01) + flows(atm, 2025-01-02 .. 2025-01-31) + gap(wallet, 2025-01-31) == bal(wallet, 2025-01-31)

ask q_flows: flows(wallet, 2025-01-02 .. 2025-01-31)

version card_facts
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  pad wallet from spent
  atm_amount = 300.00 "story: 300.00 from the cash machine"
  atm_day = 2025-01-10 "story: on 10 January"
  opening[wallet] = 400.00 at 2025-01-01 start "story: counted 400.00 on 1 January 2025"
  stated[wallet] = 250.00 at 2025-01-31 end "story: counted 250.00 on 31 January"
=== expect
q_flows: -150.00 DUK
  pad: wallet 2025-01-31 end, pads:card_facts:wallet@2025-01-31 end of -450.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: atm
  cut 2026-10-25
q_gap: -450.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: atm
  cut 2026-10-25
q_holds: ok
  pad: wallet 2025-01-31 end, pads:card_facts:wallet@2025-01-31 end of -450.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: atm
  cut 2026-10-25
q_mid: 700.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: atm
  cut 2026-10-25
q_spent: 450.00 DUK
  pad: wallet 2025-01-31 end, pads:card_facts:wallet@2025-01-31 end of -450.00 DUK
  unfulfilled: atm
  cut 2026-10-25
